cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these templates in published course materials or a thesis, you may cite them as below. Citation is appreciated, not required."
type: software
title: "latex-lecture-templates: XeLaTeX templates for Traditional Chinese science and engineering lecture notes and worked solutions"
abstract: >-
  Two XeLaTeX templates for Traditional Chinese science and engineering course
  materials: lecture notes with definition, theorem, derivation and example
  blocks sharing one numbering sequence, and worked solutions with the
  original English problem statement and Chinese solution text. Both use
  Noto Sans TC and share one A4 layout.
authors:
  - alias: Celivem
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Celivem/latex-lecture-templates"
url: "https://github.com/Celivem/latex-lecture-templates"
keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - XeLaTeX
  - xeCJK
  - template
  - lecture notes
  - Traditional Chinese
